sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: An idToken with the MastersPass as GroupId is configured
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted for EVSE 1 with idToken valid idToken
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted for EVSE 2 with idToken valid idToken2

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured masterpass_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured masterpass_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken <Configured masterPassGroupId>

    loop For both EVSE (EVSE 1 and EVSE 2)
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = MasterPass, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
        CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
        Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken <Configured masterPassGroupId>
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
